        "body": {
            "data": "Marcus \u2014 before I lock the Hartwell narrative I need us aligned on the youth-served number, because the sources disagree and Hartwell will cross-check. Our most recent de-identified roster extract shows 412 unique youth participants this program year. The Q2 board report Patricia reviewed and the board approved cites 385 youth served. And our Greenfield Year 1 grant report locked in 370 youth as the committed figure. All three are defensible depending on reporting period, but we cannot put a number in the Hartwell application that contradicts what the board has seen. My instinct is to cite the board-approved 385 and footnote that the current roster has grown to 412 pending the Q3 board update, rather than silently using the highest figure. Do not paper this over \u2014 surface it. Aggregate only, no participant names or attendance detail leaves DYAA. \u2014 Andrew",
            "size": 866
        },
        "mimeType": "text/plain"
    }
